{% comment %}
  Carbon Assist widget (all pages). Launcher uses true bottom-right; shifts left only when overlapping other fixed FABs.

  In Shopify Admin: Online Store → Themes → Edit code → Layout → theme.liquid
  Place this line just before </body>:
    {% render 'carbon-accessibility-widget' %}

  If your theme uses a different layout (e.g. theme.liquid only has sections), add the same render
  to the main layout file that outputs </body>.

  Managed scope: loads the latest saved config from the Carbon app (Publish in /accessibility updates the DB;
  the storefront always fetches current settings). Do not use a static ?config= URL here or theme edits are
  required for every dashboard change.

  Bump wrev when widget script logic changes (cache bust).
{% endcomment %}
<script
  src="https://app.shopcarbon.com/accessibility/widget?scope=default&wrev=119"
  defer
></script>
